\tag{fdip}
\title{Right multiplication on two different factors}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The regular-module isomorphism in \ref{fdip-00OS} identifies exterior
monomials with Clifford elements. The
[Hurwitz coefficient fiber](fdip-00V2) is a different algebra.
Their two right multiplications act on the same cochains,
but meet different parts of the transported operator.}

